      "description": "A woman in a kitchen, wearing oven mitts and a striped apron, is leaning forward with a distressed expression as she pulls a hot pizza from an oven that is emitting bright flames. The scene is framed to emphasize her alarmed reaction to the heat.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
